context: .
image: repro-ep_bnp:latest
notes: NeurIPS'22 "Pre-activation Distributions Expose Backdoor Neurons". Trains a BadNets-poisoned ResNet-18 on CIFAR-10 (auto-downloaded into data/ep_bnp/), then applies EP / BNP / CLP pruning. test.py prints the same labels once per defense, so each metric is anchored on its section header. Recorded values: fill from the paper's CIFAR-10 BadNets table.
